FinancialSMS-NER (DistilBERT token classifier, artifacts/best_ner_model)
https://github.com/rkuma18/FinancialSMS-NER
Rupis ships an INT8-quantized ONNX export of this model (manifest.json +
model.onnx + vocab.txt). The upstream README states: "This project is licensed
under the MIT License". The repository has no LICENSE file, so below is the
standard MIT text with the author named in the README.

